.TH VIDEOMORPH "1" "Jul 2020" "Version 1.5 Canelo" "VideoMorph"

.SH NAME
videomorph \- Video Converter based on ffmpeg, Python 3 and PyQt6.

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B videomorph

.SH DESCRIPTION
Video Converter based on ffmpeg, Python 3 and PyQt6.
Unlike other video converters, VideoMorph focuses on a single goal:
make video conversion simple, with an easy to use GUI and allowing
the user to convert to the currently most popular video formats.
VideoMorph GUI is simple and clean focused on usability, removing
annoying options rarely used.
VideoMorph is a video converter, just that. If you want a video
editor, VideoMorph isn't for you.

.SH USAGE
VideoMorph is a GUI application. Launch it from your desktop environment or by
executing \fBvideomorph\fR and use the interface to add files or folders. The
legacy command-line flags for pre-populating the task list (\fB-i\fR, \fB-d\fR,
etc.) have been removed.

